## Trash Done

Tap “placed” and stop wondering—keep a quiet record of the everyday action.

Trash Done is a local-first utility for people who forget community collection days or wonder whether they took the trash out. It records one recurring action clearly, without an account or a network connection.

RECORD THE MOMENT

• Start a focused session and enter the minimum required input
• Review the resulting card before confirming or discarding it
• Use the Home screen and calm paper-ledger presentation to stay oriented

RETURN TO WHAT YOU CONFIRMED

• Save confirmed results locally with stable timestamps
• Reopen saved results from History, newest first
• Delete an old result with a confirmation step
• Export confirmed results as plain text

PRIVATE AND FLEXIBLE

• No account, ads, analytics, tracking, or cloud sync
• Keep user-created content unchanged when switching languages
• Use English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, or Spanish
• Follow System or choose a language in Settings

Trash Done is free to use, with its complete local core available without a subscription or purchase.

Trash Done is available in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, and Spanish.

Record the moment, confirm what is done, and move on with confidence.
